    {
      "uid": "zhcn:726edd85eaf6492501a7e590",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是、是的……因为一直在调整忍耐着。\n一边看赛事……一边吃内脏煮……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "015ba8af60903c975053fc0f18f8013806698de32b5c6592d27cad639d35f85c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1404"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26c5605d803653c9123d0795",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "去寻找的话，反省点数不胜数。但是……。\n我会，站在顶点……名留青史的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d94a721bbb0ceca6c03cc4dcd6abe74bd81686778a1911e6e0916ca63900f33",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1405"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d99063187aa01b1b9a628718",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我也……能和最棒的成员们创造出\n最棒的戏剧……非常……非常，开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35c7a8873b469c7525fc23dea2d3c844e7f27e09ef0a38f85f9017d7d034a449",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1406"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18743435e90b198ac0b208db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感谢你总是给我画上双圈将我送上赛场，\n非常感谢……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c81f7638372a9590f83aedef2a4d057df03c4dcfb6edf305c63424c2d4978e4b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1407"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61ada15069847ec13cdbbf00",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我也……能和最棒的成员们创造出\n最棒的戏剧……非常……非常，开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35c7a8873b469c7525fc23dea2d3c844e7f27e09ef0a38f85f9017d7d034a449",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
