        "232",
        "1420"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7370ba54b08162f403dcbcf0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家～！　朝着复仇，加——油哦♡\n不过嘛？　还是会被我们天才组合反杀的就是啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "be66ee5a7f6bdd6bf23956a3b92321483348982658e7c17bfbbcd375531d7e41",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1421"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9bda1c49daccdb7c740f8a7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哼……啊哈哈。……啊，对、对不起！\n我只是还没……从赛事的余热中冷静下来……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "963dfafa490adee3510d52b806c52293bfc8d5b165433f074e704ad2d02b7af0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1422"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0870a61873af40c68e09d7ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在克己的尽头，达成某样事物……。\n这样的故事……能带给我勇气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "033c2b38c1335528211f16980243ed44ceb8c7d4e31a1d9e15c9c4d63781af1a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1423"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8c6fcf622e218b708af4eb8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "再给我一点……让我，吞噬更多……？\n……呵呵。当然，只是比喻哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "211663e6fbe4326f66ec0ca1511fae8ffdf9009dbba2cc6f3c65ef90be4324b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1424"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99e8d8bf70897d4921b9abad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没、没有……什么特别的讲究。不过……，\n倒是有时会被人说身上有股甜甜的香味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9387e46e0abcc1ea7f58a234ae560dd1d552c5bf4257da9bdcd21d68077cbec9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1425"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e8178ccfbd5c7ec892435b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会赢的……。我相信，那是能献给那位大人的\n最美丽的事物……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6250a8cb7777f569de62168f46a61551a390b2a7889e99d9daa5d07f1ad91c7c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1426"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa8d9ecdafbf74f5b050b899",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "再给我一点……让我，吞噬更多……？\n……呵呵。当然，只是比喻哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "211663e6fbe4326f66ec0ca1511fae8ffdf9009dbba2cc6f3c65ef90be4324b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1427"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8499aa337a39a9c316b5d7ce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没、没有……什么特别的讲究。不过……，\n倒是有时会被人说身上有股甜甜的香味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9387e46e0abcc1ea7f58a234ae560dd1d552c5bf4257da9bdcd21d68077cbec9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
